<title>PAKISTAN: PAKISTANI BANKS TO CLOSE FOR HOLIDAY ON THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>PAKISTANI BANKS TO CLOSE FOR HOLIDAY ON THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan and other banks will remain closed on Thursday, a public holiday for Independence Day, a bank official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom (9221) 5685192; Fax (9221) 5673428</p>
